# drag-k-fine (plan section 6, M7): k's number box dragged with Shift held from before the press:
# fine, a tenth of the rate (0.002 a px) on 0.001s, so +50 px holds k at 0.100, printed with its
# third decimal while the drag lasts; the stroke in --accent, the name's slot the badge
# "Fine ×0.1", the ruler under the row. k's box is (330, 452.5, 107 x 32) at 1440 x 900.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 383 468
hold Shift
wait 16
down
move 433 468 over 160
wait 300
shot drag-k-fine
